### Translate Claim Form

The claim form for this case requires translation.

Review the claim form in
<a href="/cases/case-details/PCS/PCS/{{caseReference}}#Case%20File%20View">Case File View</a> and arrange
translation.

<a href="{{uploadTranslatedClaimFormEventUrl}}">Upload the translated claim form</a> to the case and then
email it to the court. Only mark the task as complete once the translation has been completed.

Documents:
<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
  <li class="govuk-!-font-size-19">Claim - Claimant 1.pdf</li>
</ul>
